* Plasma Orb — CESHAD shader agent (classifier 2 21 42004).
*
* Injects into the world AT THE CURSOR as an ordinary carryable + mouseable
* agent, so the game's own Hand picks it up and drops it: click to pick up,
* click again to put down. (An earlier version floated the agent on the pointer
* with FREL to look "held" — but the Hand has no carry state in that case, so it
* could never be dropped. Use the engine's real carry, not a visual fake.)
*
* NB: CAOS comments must be on their OWN line — a trailing "*" comment after a
* command silently aborts the rest of the script.
new: simp 2 21 42004 "plasma" 1 0 8999
* attr 3 = carryable(1) + mouseable(2): the Hand can pick it up
attr 3
bhvr 0
shdr "plasma" { 1.0 }
* place it centred on the cursor
seta va10 targ
targ pntr
setv va00 posl
setv va01 post
targ va10
subv va00 80
subv va01 80
mvto va00 va01

* Re-attach the shader after a world load. A shdr attachment is not serialised
* with the agent, so on reload the agent would show its bare (black) surrogate
* sprite; the world-loaded (128) event re-applies it with the same parameters.
scrp 2 21 42004 128
  shdr "plasma" { 1.0 }
endm
